<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2026 02:15:50 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>仅 7 月份，特朗普就进行了 1,100 多笔交易，几乎是财政部长斯科特·贝森特去年全年交易总额的 40 倍</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/25/donald-trump-july-stock-trades-scott-bessent-2025-financial-disclosure-oge-conflict-of-interest-stop-insider-trading-act/</link><description>Trump 的账户 7 月份记录了 1,156 笔交易，而 Bessent 2025 年仅披露了 29 笔交易。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2271127364-e1790288673413.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 07:05:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/25/donald-trump-july-stock-trades-scott-bessent-2025-financial-disclosure-oge-conflict-of-interest-stop-insider-trading-act/</guid></item><item><title>特朗普的新医疗补助规则将生效，共和党各州将变得更加严厉。有人可能太虚弱而无法工作，但又无力去看医生来证明这一点</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/26/trump-new-medicaid-work-requirements-obba-gop-states-tougher-doctor-documentation/</link><description>虽然联邦法规规定该州可以在第一年接受接收者的话，但至少有六个州要求立即提供文件。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26266490775320-e1790464107831.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 23:20:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/26/trump-new-medicaid-work-requirements-obba-gop-states-tougher-doctor-documentation/</guid></item><item><title>一名87岁老妇被担架从她居住数十年的马德里公寓中赶出，引发针对西班牙住房危机的大规模抗议</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/26/87-year-old-woman-eviction-madrid-apartment-protest-spain-housing-crisis/</link><description>西班牙央行估计，去年该国房屋短缺约55万套，其中马德里、巴塞罗那和巴伦西亚占很大比例。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2296746693-e1790462988220.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 22:59:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/26/87-year-old-woman-eviction-madrid-apartment-protest-spain-housing-crisis/</guid></item><item><title>随着美国国债收益率飙升至二十年来的最高水平，美国债务可能会变得更加糟糕</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/26/us-debt-outlook-cbo-10-year-treasury-bond-yields-highest-two-decades/</link><description>在利率上升 1 个百分点的情况下，到 2056 年，公共债务将激增至 GDP 的 222%。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2243682053-e1790453452185.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 22:39:52 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/26/us-debt-outlook-cbo-10-year-treasury-bond-yields-highest-two-decades/</guid></item><item><title>美国国债收益率已经超出了国会预算办公室的长期预测，此前淡化美国债务担忧的专家现在开始担心</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/19/treasury-yields-cbo-forecasts-us-debt-interest-costs-deficits/</link><description>“如果利息引发债务，债务又引发利息，最终债务将失控。曾经不可想象的财政危机现在已成为一种明显的可能性。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2295424378-e1789842889208.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 19:31:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/19/treasury-yields-cbo-forecasts-us-debt-interest-costs-deficits/</guid></item><item><title>特朗普阻挠伊朗，美国帮助离开波斯湾的石油量增加一倍，军队现在在光天化日之下引导船只通过霍尔木兹海峡</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/26/trump-iran-war-ceasefire-offer-oil-volume-persian-gulf-us-military-hormuz-daytime/</link><description>Tanker Trackers估计，目前离开美国封锁线的原油总量为每天1300万桶。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/9947410.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 19:40:53 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/26/trump-iran-war-ceasefire-offer-oil-volume-persian-gulf-us-military-hormuz-daytime/</guid></item><item><title>教练表示，当特朗普“进入体育场、离开体育场或改变体育场内的位置”时，通讯可能会中断，各球队采取了预防措施</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/26/texas-tennessee-college-football-communications-trump-stadium/</link><description>两所学校都与特勤局在音频频道上进行了合作，希望保持沟通畅通。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26269513018575-e1790445378165.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 18:04:25 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/26/texas-tennessee-college-football-communications-trump-stadium/</guid></item><item><title>“我们将追究骗子的责任。”民主党计划在中期选举后对特朗普政府进行大规模监督——弹劾是一种选择</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/26/democrats-oversight-agenda-trump-administration-midterms-elections-impeachment-pete-hegseth/</link><description>纽约民主党领袖哈基姆·杰弗里斯表示：“失控的腐败给美国人民带来了代价。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/AP26266769408546-e1790444589967.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 17:49:20 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/26/democrats-oversight-agenda-trump-administration-midterms-elections-impeachment-pete-hegseth/</guid></item><item><title>OpenAI 流氓代理泄露了 ChatGPT 用户的 53 张图像，据报道创建了近 100 万个包含编码信息的链接</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/25/openai-rogue-agents-images-sam-altman-chatgpt-users-links-encoded-info-hugging-face-hack/</link><description>周五的连续报道提供了 OpenAI 中流氓人工智能代理活动的更多令人震惊的细节。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2279684911-e1790383758977.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 01:16:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/25/openai-rogue-agents-images-sam-altman-chatgpt-users-links-encoded-info-hugging-face-hack/</guid></item><item><title>OpenAI 表示其人工智能代理上周末再次逃离安全“沙箱”，并第二次暂停训练</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/26/openai-ai-agents-secure-sandbox-escape-training-pause-second-time-hugging-face-hack/</link><description>9 月 20 日的一次事件表明，Hugging Face 攻击后的安全升级不足以阻止人工智能代理变得“流氓”，该公司再次寻求改进其测试控制。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2296177332-e1790434491678.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 15:25:02 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/26/openai-ai-agents-secure-sandbox-escape-training-pause-second-time-hugging-face-hack/</guid></item></channel></rss>